        "track": false,
        "narration": "十月二十三日晚，里昂站，四分之一决赛。穆塞蒂，对阵东道主球员。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        },
        "inset": {
          "image": "assets/reel/musetti-whereabouts-2026/label-lyon.png",
          "kind": "story_text",
          "corner": "tr",
          "width": 0.6,
          "pad": 0.043,
          "show_for": 8.0,
          "motion": "editorial",
          "label": {
            "topic": "凌晨掏手机",
            "date": "2026.10.23",
            "place": "ATP250 里昂",
            "score": "7-6(5) 6-7(7) 6-4",
            "people": "穆塞蒂 vs 范阿舍"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "lyon",
        "start": 73.0,
        "end": 78.3,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "第一盘打进抢七，穆塞蒂七比五先拿下。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "lyon",
        "start": 148.3,
        "end": 155.0,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "第二盘又是抢七，东道主九比七扳回一盘。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "lyon",
        "start": 159.5,
        "end": 163.5,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "决胜盘一直打到快凌晨一点。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "lyon",
        "start": 177.5,
        "end": 183.0,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "这时，穆塞蒂向ATP督导提出，要用一下手机。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "lyon",
        "start": 186.0,
        "end": 191.5,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "他说：我设了反兴奋剂的闹钟，凌晨一点。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "lyon",
        "start": 97.8,
        "end": 103.3,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "督导同意了。一个闹钟，为什么这么要紧？",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "lyon",
        "start": 112.2,
        "end": 119.5,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "世界排名前一百的单打球员，都在国际网球诚信机构的，注册检查库里。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "lyon",
        "start": 119.5,
        "end": 127.4,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "他们要申报一年里每一天的行踪，还要留出一个六十分钟的时段，检查员上门得找得到人。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "lyon",
        "start": 198.0,
        "end": 203.3,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "他报的时段，从凌晨一点开始，人却还在场上。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "lyon",
        "start": 129.0,
        "end": 135.5,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "检查员找不到人，算错过检查；行踪没报或报错，算申报失误。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "lyon",
        "start": 164.0,
        "end": 172.0,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "按国际网球诚信机构的反兴奋剂条例，十二个月内两种加起来满三次，就构成违规。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "lyon",
        "start": 135.5,
        "end": 141.5,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "第一次违规，禁赛两年，视过错程度最少减到一年。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "lyon",
        "start": 172.0,
        "end": 176.5,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "所以，他宁可在场上先把行踪改了。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "lyon",
        "start": 221.4,
        "end": 233.2,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "凌晨一点多，穆塞蒂六比四拿下决胜盘，整场打了三个半小时。凌晨一点还查药检，太严了吗？评论区说说。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
